-- NOT READ by W3: the two cards themselves (W4's thread); W1's grade and readback files in git (the Wall posts name them); n8n. Wall 11777 is named as the source of the finding and was read in an earlier turn, not again for this row.
-- HASH KINDS: W4's notes and Wall posts name files by sha256 prefixes. md5_written holds the md5 of the two targets as W3 computed them; each build_files element gives both. W1's build grade (Wall 11831) names no target hash; its grades elements carry W3's md5 of the file W1 graded. W1: confirm the two md5 values against your copies.
-- objective_met is 'in part': written and read back MATCH; shown offline on run 42373's stored rounds; no live run yet.
